--------------------------- MODULE MCRNClientIoDecrypt ---------------------------
(***************************************************************************)
(* The small instance of RNClientIoDecrypt: receive buffers of two         *)
(* records, four datagrams in a behaviour chosen from the challenge,       *)
(* genuine session sequences 1..3 sent in order, one replayed copy of a    *)
(* sent sequence (a duplicate, or too old once the window has passed it)   *)
(* and one forged session datagram; a replay window of width 1, so the     *)
(* copy of sequence 1 after sequence 2 has opened is too old within four   *)
(* datagrams; an integrity limit of one.  MCRNClientIoDecrypt.cfg is the   *)
(* full instance with every rule on (bench debt, over the case budget);    *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptReduced.cfg is the required control, three datagrams.*)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenOpenBeforeReplay.cfg,                          *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenSharedWindow.cfg,                              *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenNoRetire.cfg,                                  *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenCountOnIo.cfg,                                 *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenPayloadGate.cfg,                               *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenPayloadMark.cfg and                            *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenForgedReplay.cfg each restore one defect and   *)
(* must fail; MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenNoRetireLive.cfg and                *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptBrokenSharedWindowLive.cfg restore a defect under    *)
(* SpecFair and must fail its liveness property.  Three reach witnesses   *)
(* show a branch is reached: MCRNClientIoDecryptReachLateView.cfg, a       *)
(* payload passed raw after the store; MCRNClientIoDecryptReachTooOld.cfg, *)
(* a copy the I/O thread refuses as too old; and                           *)
(* MCRNClientIoDecryptReachCountedFailure.cfg, an integrity failure        *)
(* counted short of the limit.  README-RNClientIoDecrypt.md               *)
(* gives the traces TLC printed and the check of each by hand.             *)
(***************************************************************************)
EXTENDS RNClientIoDecrypt
=============================================================================
